name: Host State Ordinance (HSO)
description: SR 192.121 — Ordinance of 7 December 2007 to the Federal Act on the Privileges, Immunities and Facilities and the Financial Subsidies granted by Switzerland as a Host State (Host State Ordinance, HSO). Unofficial English mirror of the Fedlex consolidation of 1 January 2019. No legal force.
